# DIAGNOSTICS

`<n> syscalls, over the ceiling of <c>`, `<path>:<line>: a call by number; name it from the ABI headers`, `IMPORTS.tsv names <path>, which isn't in the tree`, `<driver> has <n> lines with unsafe, over its record of <r>`, and `<driver> has <n> lines with unsafe, under its record of <r>: lower it in docs/unsafe.tsv`.
